## CRITICAL REQUIREMENTS

### 1. ONE PAGE ONLY
- Must fit on a single 8.5" x 11" page
- No multi-page capability statements
- Dense, professional layout

### 2. HEADER
- "DEE DAVIS INC." in large, bold text (28pt+)
- Service type below in colored caps (14pt)
- Colors: Navy (#1e3a5f) for company name, Teal (#0d9488) for service type

### 3. EXECUTIVE SUMMARY
- 3-4 lines maximum
- Must mention: EDWOSB, agency name (2+ times), key capability, deployment-ready
- Example: "DEE DAVIS INC. is an SBA-certified EDWOSB prime contractor delivering [service] to [agency]. With 7+ years of proven performance..."

### 4. EXECUTION FRAMEWORK LINE
- Always: "EXECUTION FRAMEWORK: Identify → Pursue → Build → Manage → Deliver → Sustain"
- Centered, gray text, bordered top and bottom

### 5. CORE COMPETENCIES
- Header: "CORE COMPETENCIES — PROVEN PERFORMANCE ACROSS [SECTOR]"
- 8 boxes in a 4x2 grid
- Each box: Title (bold, teal) + 2-line description
- Tailored to the specific opportunity

### 6. TWO-COLUMN SECTION
- Left: "PAST PERFORMANCE — VERIFIED TRACK RECORD" (6 items)
- Right: "DIFFERENTIATORS" (7 items)
- Always include:
  - EDWOSB SOLE-SOURCE ELIGIBLE — UP TO $7M
  - ZERO COMPLIANCE DEFICIENCIES
  - TWIC-CLEARED SECURE ACCESS
  - MULTI-STATE, MULTI-SECTOR PRIME

### 7. CERTIFICATIONS BAR
- Navy/teal gradient background, white text
- "EDWOSB | WOSB | WBE | MBE | SBE | E-Verify Participant | SWFT Authorized (DCSA) | TWIC Credentialed (TSA)"

### 8. STRATEGIC ALLIANCE PARTNERS
- List relevant partners for the service type
- Example: "eScreen/Quest Diagnostics • Lyft for Business • Regional Networks"

### 9. CONTACT BLOCK
- Name: "Dieasha Davis, President & CEO"
- Phone: (248) 376-4550
- Email: info@deedavis.biz
- Web: www.deedavis.biz
- Address: 755 W. Big Beaver Rd., Ste 2020, Troy, MI 48084
- Tagline: "The Professionals' Professional" (right-aligned, italic)

### 10. FOOTER
- CAGE: 8UMX3 | UEI: HJB4KNYJVGZ1 | DUNS: 002636755 | SAM.gov: ACTIVE | Est. 2018
- "Federal • State • Commercial • Sole-Source Eligible Up to $7M"
- MC: 1647572 | DOT: 4250594 | Primary: MI, GA, FL, MD | CONUS
